WEBVTT

01:48.280 --> 01:49.120
Yu'e,

01:50.240 --> 01:51.080
let's go.

01:52.360 --> 01:54.400
We already talked to the Zhou family

01:55.400 --> 01:56.520
about taking you back.

01:57.320 --> 01:58.160
Yu'e,

01:58.240 --> 01:59.640
come back with us.

01:59.720 --> 02:00.560
I'm not leaving.

02:02.480 --> 02:03.600
I'll be nothing

02:04.280 --> 02:05.800
if I leave.

02:05.880 --> 02:08.199
As long as I take good care of him,

02:08.280 --> 02:10.000
he'll get better.

02:10.080 --> 02:13.200
Then after we have a child,

02:13.280 --> 02:14.880
I'll be Mrs. Zhou.

02:14.960 --> 02:16.400
I want to stay here.

02:16.960 --> 02:18.200
I want to be Mrs. Zhou.

02:19.000 --> 02:19.840
Yu'e.

02:23.760 --> 02:24.720
Let's go.

02:48.480 --> 02:49.840
Yanbang,

02:50.840 --> 02:54.000
you beat me up so badly before.

02:55.560 --> 02:59.120
I won't go anywhere from now on.

03:04.560 --> 03:06.760
I'll be your wife

03:08.760 --> 03:11.440
and take good care of you

03:13.920 --> 03:18.480
so you can live happily.

03:22.920 --> 03:25.040
JIANG RESIDENCE

03:25.880 --> 03:27.200
You've brought so many gifts.

03:27.280 --> 03:28.560
That's very kind of you.

03:29.520 --> 03:31.440
We're all looking forward

03:31.520 --> 03:33.880
to having Ruoyao marry into our family.

03:37.280 --> 03:39.040
Isn't Yao'er dressed yet?

03:39.600 --> 03:41.440
Perhaps she is embarrassed.

03:41.520 --> 03:43.200
There's no rush.

03:46.280 --> 03:47.280
Yao'er,

03:48.440 --> 03:49.520
you should greet Mrs. Qi.

03:52.640 --> 03:53.720
Greetings, Mrs. Qi.

03:55.840 --> 03:56.880
Ms. Jiang Ruoyao.

04:03.760 --> 04:06.480
I heard that Mrs. Zhou
came to your residence

04:06.560 --> 04:07.960
and made a scene yesterday.

04:08.040 --> 04:10.520
Ruoyao, did you get frightened?

04:12.200 --> 04:14.360
She did suffer a bit.

04:14.960 --> 04:16.839
A woman her age

04:16.920 --> 04:18.240
always has pursuers.

04:18.320 --> 04:20.519
Only after getting engaged
can you have peace of mind.

04:21.360 --> 04:23.800
Let's hold the marriage
between our families soon.

04:24.280 --> 04:25.840
You're right.

04:25.920 --> 04:28.480
I got someone to check the date.

04:28.560 --> 04:30.720
It's an auspicious day after three days.

04:31.200 --> 04:33.400
Let's set the date on that day.

04:34.080 --> 04:35.440
There's no need to be so hasty.

04:38.080 --> 04:39.440
Let's do as you said.

04:40.000 --> 04:42.240
Please leave us a list of guests.

04:42.320 --> 04:44.360
Let me see if we left anyone out.

04:44.920 --> 04:47.240
Look, the list is already prepared.

04:47.320 --> 04:49.200
The marriage between our families

04:49.280 --> 04:51.480
must be a grand wedding

04:51.560 --> 04:53.680
- Yes.
- for everyone in the capital to see.

04:53.760 --> 04:55.960
Ruoyao, don't you think so?

04:56.040 --> 04:58.480
- There's no need to be so extravagant.
- Yao'er.

05:01.720 --> 05:04.280
Mrs. Qi, we'll trouble you
to deliver the invitations quickly then.

05:04.360 --> 05:05.360
Yes.

05:05.440 --> 05:08.400
There is a lot of work to be done.

05:08.480 --> 05:11.000
Jiang Ruoyao, think carefully

05:11.800 --> 05:13.960
about the kind of person you are.

05:14.520 --> 05:16.720
I think we should get back to work on it.

05:17.240 --> 05:18.240
We'll get going now.

05:22.320 --> 05:23.160
Mrs. Qi, please wait.

05:26.480 --> 05:27.440
I don't agree

05:28.360 --> 05:29.560
with this marriage.

05:33.440 --> 05:35.360
If you didn't want to marry Mr. Qi,

05:35.440 --> 05:36.840
you should have said so earlier.

05:36.920 --> 05:39.480
Why did you reject
the Qi family's offer of marriage

05:39.560 --> 05:41.760
to their face and humiliate them?

05:41.840 --> 05:42.960
Your mother worked so hard

05:43.040 --> 05:45.440
to arrange these things for you.

05:45.520 --> 05:47.120
You've embarrassed her.

05:47.680 --> 05:50.080
If it's embarrassing for Mother,
isn't it embarrassing for me?

05:50.160 --> 05:51.040
You…

05:51.120 --> 05:53.320
If only Mother listened to me,

05:53.880 --> 05:55.000
would this have happened?

05:56.440 --> 05:59.240
Listen. She's blaming me for this.

06:00.000 --> 06:02.000
Since you and Zhou Yanbang
broke off the engagement,

06:02.080 --> 06:04.080
I searched so many families

06:04.920 --> 06:06.720
before I found this one.

06:07.360 --> 06:10.680
I think Mr. Qi is as good as Zhou Yanbang.

06:12.080 --> 06:13.040
Why did you…

06:13.120 --> 06:15.480
What is it about him
that you're dissatisfied with?

06:16.040 --> 06:17.360
I'm not dissatisfied with him.

06:17.440 --> 06:18.720
Then why did you do that?

06:18.800 --> 06:20.000
I'm dissatisfied

06:21.080 --> 06:22.000
with Mother.

06:22.880 --> 06:24.120
What did you say?

06:24.200 --> 06:27.640
Mother, I know you've done a lot for me.

06:27.720 --> 06:29.000
Ever since I was a kid,

06:30.040 --> 06:31.440
have you ever thought

06:31.520 --> 06:33.680
about whether I wanted
any of those things?

06:35.640 --> 06:36.680
When I was eight,

06:37.240 --> 06:38.640
Father wanted to take me on a trip.

06:39.520 --> 06:42.600
You said it was inappropriate for a girl
to be seen in public too early.

06:43.600 --> 06:46.080
When I was ten,
you forced me to play the guqin.

06:47.360 --> 06:49.880
Even when my fingers bled and had scabs,
you wouldn't let me rest.

06:50.640 --> 06:52.760
When I was 12 and fell sick,

06:53.480 --> 06:54.680
you forced me to take medicine.

06:55.160 --> 06:57.840
When I refused,
you made Ms. Sun force me to swallow it.

06:58.880 --> 07:01.200
You didn't even ask me
if I wanted to switch with Jiang Li

07:01.280 --> 07:03.200
in the engagement.

07:03.280 --> 07:05.120
You love him so much though.

07:05.200 --> 07:06.280
Yes.

07:06.840 --> 07:08.760
Although it was a choice
you forced me to make,

07:08.840 --> 07:10.680
I like him and I don't resent you.

07:11.760 --> 07:14.120
But I've already paid enough for it.

07:14.680 --> 07:15.840
So from now on,

07:16.880 --> 07:18.800
I'm going to do what I want.

07:19.680 --> 07:22.600
Please don't intervene
in my marriage, Mother.

07:23.160 --> 07:24.640
Do you know what you're talking about?

07:25.400 --> 07:27.120
You insisted on marrying
Zhou Yanbang before

07:27.200 --> 07:28.800
and now you're blaming me for everything.

07:28.880 --> 07:30.360
Are you out of your mind?

07:30.920 --> 07:32.120
I'm not out of my mind.

07:34.440 --> 07:36.640
I was infatuated with Zhou Yanbang.

07:37.680 --> 07:40.960
Even though I realized
he was not loyal and kind,

07:41.800 --> 07:43.360
I was still infatuated with him.

07:44.080 --> 07:47.080
But now I understand.

07:47.160 --> 07:49.080
I wasn't really infatuated with him.

07:49.160 --> 07:50.440
I just wanted

07:51.080 --> 07:52.760
a chance to escape from the Jiang family.

07:53.280 --> 07:54.320
I wanted to escape from you

07:55.320 --> 07:56.960
even if it meant using my marriage.

08:00.520 --> 08:03.080
Mother, I knew nothing before.

08:04.240 --> 08:05.760
But now, I understand everything.

08:06.320 --> 08:07.560
You're the reason

08:08.680 --> 08:09.840
I've become like this.

08:09.920 --> 08:10.800
You…

08:11.280 --> 08:12.120
You…

08:14.920 --> 08:16.480
Dear, look at her.

08:17.200 --> 08:18.040
Ruoyao, you…

08:18.760 --> 08:19.600
Enough.

08:20.080 --> 08:21.920
It's not like it's a big deal.

08:22.760 --> 08:24.840
I was just like her when I was young.

08:25.840 --> 08:27.720
It was my choice
to marry your father myself

08:27.800 --> 08:30.800
after I canceled the engagement my parents

08:30.880 --> 08:32.320
arranged for me.

08:32.880 --> 08:34.520
And it worked out just fine.

08:36.720 --> 08:37.720
I've always thought

08:38.400 --> 08:40.520
that Ruoyao didn't have a mind of her own

08:41.559 --> 08:43.280
and could only listen to you, Ji Shuran.

08:44.000 --> 08:46.440
It turns out
that she knows what she wants now.

08:47.320 --> 08:48.160
That's good.

08:49.120 --> 08:50.880
Why don't we listen to her once

08:50.960 --> 08:52.400
and let her make her own choice?

08:52.480 --> 08:53.920
But the Qi family…

08:54.480 --> 08:56.040
Mr. Qi is a man.

08:56.120 --> 08:56.960
What's the matter?

08:57.440 --> 08:59.040
Would he feel so aggrieved to resent us?

08:59.120 --> 09:00.840
- Old Madam.
- Dear.

09:00.920 --> 09:04.280
Dear, since Ruoyao wants
to make her choice…

09:05.200 --> 09:06.560
You decide yourself then.

09:07.680 --> 09:10.480
That way, you'll have
some peace and quiet too.

09:11.040 --> 09:12.440
Just let her be.

09:12.520 --> 09:13.680
Come on, sit down.

09:13.760 --> 09:14.840
Sit.

09:15.600 --> 09:16.440
Sit down.

09:22.960 --> 09:24.160
It's Jiang Li, isn't it?

09:24.760 --> 09:25.960
Did she teach you to say that?

09:26.040 --> 09:27.040
No one taught me anything.

09:27.520 --> 09:30.480
Those are just the words
I've wanted to say

09:30.560 --> 09:32.200
but never dared to for so many years.

09:32.280 --> 09:33.120
All these years

09:33.720 --> 09:34.560
in this family,

09:35.480 --> 09:37.440
I'm the only one
who truly wants what's good for you.

09:37.520 --> 09:39.640
Jiang Li instigated you to do this.
Do you know that?

09:39.720 --> 09:41.760
She said all those things to confuse you.

09:42.520 --> 09:44.160
She's doing it for her own benefit.

09:44.240 --> 09:45.520
She's trying to set you up.

09:45.600 --> 09:47.000
Jiang Li doesn't want to set me up.

09:48.080 --> 09:50.600
That day,
from the beginning until the end,

09:50.680 --> 09:53.240
she never mentioned
that I eloped with Zhou Yanbang.

09:55.440 --> 09:56.440
It's you

09:57.160 --> 09:59.200
who has been trying
to make her testify against me.

09:59.280 --> 10:00.120
What do you know?

10:00.760 --> 10:01.920
If she dared to accuse you,

10:02.000 --> 10:04.200
it would prove she was slandering you

10:04.280 --> 10:06.040
and she wouldn't be able
to get away easily.

10:06.120 --> 10:06.960
What about me?

10:07.440 --> 10:08.400
What about my reputation

10:09.160 --> 10:10.320
and my feelings?

10:10.400 --> 10:12.440
All you want to do is ruin Jiang Li.

10:12.520 --> 10:14.040
Have you ever thought about me?

10:14.120 --> 10:15.880
You always say people want to set me up.

10:16.360 --> 10:20.040
But actually, you just don't want me
to trust anyone else

10:20.120 --> 10:21.600
so I'll do what you say.

10:23.240 --> 10:24.360
Madam Ji.

10:24.440 --> 10:25.960
Do you know how much

10:26.040 --> 10:27.200
I've sacrificed for you?

10:30.520 --> 10:31.360
Are you referring

10:32.520 --> 10:33.360
to getting rid

10:35.000 --> 10:36.520
of Jiang Li and Jiang Yue for me?

10:36.600 --> 10:37.440
What do you mean?

10:39.520 --> 10:40.760
I don't mean anything.

10:40.840 --> 10:42.000
I just want you to know

10:42.520 --> 10:44.400
that I don't need you to do these for me.

10:44.480 --> 10:45.760
I, Jiang Ruoyao,

10:46.400 --> 10:49.040
don't have to step
on people's corpses to get to the top.

10:49.880 --> 10:52.480
Besides, if I have to step

10:52.560 --> 10:54.280
on people's corpses to get to the top,

10:55.160 --> 10:56.720
I'd rather not get there.

10:57.280 --> 10:59.760
I'm going to tell Father later

11:00.320 --> 11:01.560
that I'm going on a study tour.

11:02.040 --> 11:03.160
I don't want to get married.

11:04.040 --> 11:04.960
Madam Ji, don't.

11:05.040 --> 11:06.680
Ms. Ruoyao, apologize to your mother now.

11:06.760 --> 11:07.680
She'll forgive you.

11:07.760 --> 11:09.600
- I won't.
- Starting today,

11:10.440 --> 11:11.680
she's not allowed to see anyone.

11:12.960 --> 11:13.800
Well…

11:23.680 --> 11:26.040
Are you still upset about Ruoyao?

11:26.120 --> 11:28.760
It's fine that Ruoyao's engagement
with the Qi family was canceled.

11:28.840 --> 11:30.480
They're not a great family anyway.

11:30.560 --> 11:31.760
Later on,

11:31.840 --> 11:32.880
I'll just ask His Majesty

11:32.960 --> 11:35.320
to find another good match for Ruoyao.

11:35.400 --> 11:37.840
I'm not upset
about the marriage, but Ruoyao.

11:38.760 --> 11:40.480
Jiang Li bewitched her.

11:40.560 --> 11:41.960
She's a different person now.

11:42.040 --> 11:43.440
I can't discipline her anymore.

11:43.520 --> 11:46.920
How dare Jiang Li lay a hand on Ruoyao?

11:47.000 --> 11:48.120
If this goes on,

11:49.760 --> 11:51.200
it'll be hard to deal with her.

11:51.280 --> 11:53.800
I must get rid of her this time.

11:53.880 --> 11:55.080
Back then,

11:55.160 --> 11:56.600
I remember you took her out

11:56.680 --> 11:58.640
of the Court of Judicial Review's
prison yourself.

11:59.320 --> 12:02.880
I thought she'd feel
some gratitude towards you.

12:03.440 --> 12:04.640
But now, it seems like

12:05.640 --> 12:06.520
I was wrong.

12:06.600 --> 12:08.040
I don't regret saving her.

12:08.760 --> 12:12.320
After all, I didn't want to make things
difficult for Jiang Yuanbai.

12:12.880 --> 12:15.320
Do you have a plan that will work?

12:32.040 --> 12:34.440
Why are you involved
with the Eldest Princess?

12:34.520 --> 12:35.840
Why did she go to you?

12:35.920 --> 12:37.560
Don't let her use you.

12:38.160 --> 12:40.040
The enemy of my enemy is my friend.

12:40.680 --> 12:42.960
She wants Jiang Li to die more than I do.

12:45.920 --> 12:48.440
I guess you've made up your mind.

12:48.520 --> 12:49.760
Don't worry.

12:50.280 --> 12:52.920
I'll definitely get rid of her this time.

12:56.200 --> 12:57.760
JIANG RESIDENCE

13:01.120 --> 13:01.960
My lady,

13:02.040 --> 13:03.240
I got a letter from home.

13:03.320 --> 13:06.040
There's news about Ms. Haitang,
whom you asked me to find.

13:06.760 --> 13:08.320
- Sit down first.
- All right.

13:11.640 --> 13:14.480
Ms. Haitang, whom you're looking for,
is from a rice shop in the village.

13:14.560 --> 13:17.040
She worked as a maid for a lady
in an official's house

13:17.120 --> 13:18.400
and left many years ago.

13:18.480 --> 13:20.600
Not long ago,
a woman appeared in the village.

13:21.160 --> 13:22.640
But she had a long cut

13:23.320 --> 13:25.040
on her cheek

13:25.120 --> 13:26.440
with the inner flesh visible.

13:26.520 --> 13:27.880
It was horrible.

13:27.960 --> 13:30.400
I'm not sure
if she's the one you're looking for.

13:31.000 --> 13:34.200
Does anyone else know
about what I asked you to do?

13:34.280 --> 13:35.360
Don't worry, Ms. Jiang Li.

13:35.440 --> 13:36.920
I've already told

13:37.000 --> 13:39.040
my sister-in-law as you instructed me.

13:39.600 --> 13:41.200
The woman was not alerted.

13:42.720 --> 13:44.240
I'll get a hot pot of tea.

13:44.320 --> 13:45.160
All right.

14:00.760 --> 14:01.680
My lady.

14:03.040 --> 14:03.880
Haitang.

14:06.680 --> 14:07.560
Why are you here?

14:08.400 --> 14:09.680
I'll take you out.

14:12.600 --> 14:13.560
What did they do to you?

14:14.040 --> 14:15.360
Shen Residence is hell.

14:15.920 --> 14:17.320
I'm going to get you out of here.

14:17.400 --> 14:18.520
Forget about me first.

14:20.280 --> 14:23.200
Find a way to send a message to Xue Zhao,

14:23.760 --> 14:24.720
so he'll come to save me.

14:25.320 --> 14:26.160
My lady.

14:26.240 --> 14:27.160
Go now.

14:27.720 --> 14:29.640
Don't fight with them.

14:30.520 --> 14:31.360
Wait for Mr. Xue.

14:32.040 --> 14:32.880
Don't worry.

14:33.440 --> 14:34.280
Go now.

14:42.280 --> 14:44.560
But she had a long cut

14:44.640 --> 14:45.920
on her cheek.

14:46.640 --> 14:48.280
I don't know what happened to her.

14:50.160 --> 14:52.560
If you need help, blow this whistle.

14:52.640 --> 14:54.400
My men will come to protect you for me.

15:13.560 --> 15:14.880
It doesn't seem useful.

15:23.480 --> 15:24.920
My lady, any instructions for me?

15:32.400 --> 15:34.360
Come here. Put it here on the ground.

15:34.440 --> 15:36.320
One pot here,
one pot over here, understand?

15:36.400 --> 15:37.720
Aren't you the gardener?

15:39.000 --> 15:40.400
What's your name?

15:40.480 --> 15:41.480
My name is Zhao Ke.

15:41.560 --> 15:42.640
Zhao Ke?

15:42.720 --> 15:44.240
How long have you been at Jiang Residence?

15:46.560 --> 15:47.840
Since your master

15:47.920 --> 15:50.080
told me about your existence,

15:50.160 --> 15:52.080
he must have expected me
to ask you this question.

15:52.920 --> 15:53.800
Just tell me.

15:54.280 --> 15:56.280
I assure you.
He won't chastise you for it.

15:56.360 --> 15:57.640
I came here seven years ago.

15:58.200 --> 15:59.040
Seven years?

16:03.000 --> 16:06.000
It seems like he knows every move I make

16:06.080 --> 16:07.800
in this courtyard then.

16:07.880 --> 16:10.160
My lady, do you have any instructions?

16:11.040 --> 16:12.680
I want you to find out

16:13.560 --> 16:16.400
where Ji Shuran went and who she met.

16:16.480 --> 16:17.320
Yes.

16:18.080 --> 16:18.920
Also,

16:20.200 --> 16:22.200
I'd like you to take someone back
to the capital for me.

16:23.760 --> 16:26.120
But his lordship only asked me
to keep you safe.

16:26.680 --> 16:28.040
The person I want you to find

16:28.640 --> 16:30.080
is a threat to my safety if she falls

16:30.160 --> 16:31.400
into someone else's hands.

16:33.120 --> 16:33.960
I understand now.

16:48.320 --> 16:49.520
Are you referring

16:50.120 --> 16:50.960
to getting rid

16:51.040 --> 16:52.560
of Jiang Li and Jiang Yue for me?

16:57.640 --> 16:58.680
Ji Shuran,

16:58.760 --> 17:01.400
I told you before
that things wouldn't end well for you.

17:01.960 --> 17:04.880
It's only a matter of time
before my Li'er reveals all the misdeeds

17:05.359 --> 17:06.560
you've done.

17:20.040 --> 17:21.560
I can get rid of Jiang Li for you.

17:21.640 --> 17:22.839
It all depends on you.

17:29.680 --> 17:30.520
Madam Ji,

17:30.600 --> 17:32.280
the carriage and gifts are ready.

17:43.280 --> 17:44.120
Madam Ji.

17:47.640 --> 17:48.960
You don't have to force yourself

17:49.560 --> 17:50.520
if it's hard.

17:51.120 --> 17:53.320
Since I already made a choice,

17:53.400 --> 17:54.720
I must see it through to the end.

18:00.680 --> 18:02.840
JI RESIDENCE

18:09.280 --> 18:11.040
You thought of visiting me

18:11.640 --> 18:13.520
after messing up
the marriage with the Qi family.

18:16.280 --> 18:18.360
I'm about to retire

18:18.440 --> 18:20.880
and I want Qi Wenbin to take over.

18:20.960 --> 18:22.480
A marriage between the two families

18:22.560 --> 18:24.200
will bring benefits and no harm.

18:25.120 --> 18:26.200
But now,

18:27.120 --> 18:29.560
the marriage is off the table
and we've offended the Qi family.

18:30.040 --> 18:32.920
You've ruined such a good plan.

18:33.520 --> 18:34.680
Father, you still can't change

18:34.760 --> 18:37.120
your habit of finding fault in others.

18:37.200 --> 18:38.800
Do you think I like to find faults?

18:40.080 --> 18:42.640
You're the one who caused me
the most trouble in the Ji family.

18:42.720 --> 18:45.760
You chose to elope with that poor painter

18:45.840 --> 18:48.360
instead of going down the path
to wealth that I arranged for you.

18:48.920 --> 18:50.320
If I hadn't found you,

18:50.800 --> 18:52.480
how could you be who you are today?

18:52.560 --> 18:54.120
Not only are you unthankful,

18:54.200 --> 18:55.360
you even dare to doubt me.

18:58.600 --> 19:00.360
If you dare to come near
my daughter again,

19:01.000 --> 19:03.080
I'll let you die
without a grave to your name!

19:03.160 --> 19:04.480
It's all my fault.

19:06.560 --> 19:07.880
Please spare his life.

19:07.960 --> 19:09.200
Remember what happened to him.

19:09.280 --> 19:12.520
If you ever disobey me again,

19:13.520 --> 19:14.520
I'll ruin

19:15.040 --> 19:16.480
any man you love.

19:20.520 --> 19:21.760
If I didn't do that,

19:22.280 --> 19:24.680
how could you have become
the Chancellor's wife now?

19:24.760 --> 19:25.920
Father, have you forgotten

19:26.000 --> 19:27.600
how I became the Chancellor's wife?

19:28.320 --> 19:29.320
At that time,

19:29.400 --> 19:31.800
you were going to sell me
to a retarded man.

19:31.880 --> 19:32.840
You told me

19:33.760 --> 19:34.600
to be patient.

19:35.240 --> 19:36.400
After marrying a retarded man,

19:36.880 --> 19:40.680
I'd be in charge of Marquis's Residence
after having a kid or two in a few years.

19:41.640 --> 19:44.840
Then I'll have both money and power.

19:45.600 --> 19:47.840
You said it was better

19:47.920 --> 19:49.520
than marrying a painter who has nothing.

19:50.240 --> 19:52.320
I begged you on my knees
and asked not to marry him.

19:52.840 --> 19:55.560
You said I had to marry him
unless I found someone

19:56.520 --> 19:58.440
from a better family.

19:58.520 --> 20:00.960
Didn't you find someone better?

20:04.280 --> 20:05.440
Shuran,

20:05.520 --> 20:06.480
it has been hard on you.

20:07.320 --> 20:09.640
You must come here every day
to keep a sickly woman company.

20:09.720 --> 20:10.960
We're like sisters.

20:11.600 --> 20:12.800
I'll surely stay with you

20:12.880 --> 20:14.040
until you're better.

20:27.200 --> 20:28.120
I'll get going.

20:28.200 --> 20:29.480
I'll be back tomorrow to see you.

20:46.600 --> 20:47.840
Chancellor Jiang, don't worry.

20:48.320 --> 20:49.840
Mrs. Jiang is getting better.

20:54.840 --> 20:56.960
You don't agree
with the marriage I've arranged

20:57.040 --> 20:58.560
and can't marry into the Jiang family.

20:58.640 --> 20:59.880
What else can you do?

20:59.960 --> 21:01.480
Zhenzhen is getting better now.

21:02.360 --> 21:03.760
I couldn't have predicted that.

21:03.840 --> 21:06.440
Illnesses tend to flare up
again and again.

21:06.520 --> 21:09.800
If you make her condition worse,

21:10.360 --> 21:12.280
you can marry into the Jiang family.

21:13.200 --> 21:14.080
How can I do that?

21:16.080 --> 21:18.600
Now, you have two choices.

21:19.360 --> 21:21.480
Either you marry that retarded man

21:21.560 --> 21:23.000
or you do something

21:23.480 --> 21:25.640
to become Jiang Yuanbai's legitimate wife.

21:25.720 --> 21:28.880
I think you know which choice to make.

21:30.680 --> 21:31.840
You turned me

21:31.920 --> 21:33.920
into what I am today step by step.

21:34.000 --> 21:36.120
Father, I should be thanking you

21:36.200 --> 21:37.760
for letting me inherit your viciousness,

21:39.480 --> 21:41.320
always wanting
to harm others when threatened,

21:42.440 --> 21:44.440
and ultimately exposing me
to attacks from all sides.

21:44.520 --> 21:45.640
Your problem

21:46.280 --> 21:47.920
is that you are not vicious

21:48.000 --> 21:49.120
and cruel enough.

21:49.200 --> 21:51.000
I thought you had improved

21:51.080 --> 21:52.360
by killing Jiang Yuanbai's wife.

21:52.440 --> 21:55.240
But when I told you
to kill that concubine later on,

21:55.320 --> 21:56.560
you said she was not a threat.

21:56.640 --> 21:58.400
When I told you to kill Jiang Li,

21:58.480 --> 22:00.040
you said she couldn't create much stir.

22:00.120 --> 22:03.200
Now that they've started
to get in your way,

22:03.280 --> 22:04.680
do you feel good?

22:04.760 --> 22:05.600
You're right.

22:06.080 --> 22:07.840
I'm not vicious enough.

22:07.920 --> 22:09.360
So now, I've figured it out.

22:09.880 --> 22:11.560
I should be more vicious.

22:11.640 --> 22:13.760
Why should I bear all the consequences?

22:14.640 --> 22:15.520
What do you mean?

22:17.360 --> 22:18.200
Father,

22:19.120 --> 22:20.280
doesn't this tea

22:21.600 --> 22:22.800
make you feel sleepy?

22:25.720 --> 22:26.800
Father,

22:26.880 --> 22:27.760
it's the finest tea.

22:28.240 --> 22:29.080
Please try it.

22:32.040 --> 22:33.800
What are you trying to do?

22:33.880 --> 22:35.680
Liu Wencai is back.

22:36.520 --> 22:38.440
He's back to help you
teach me to be cruel.

22:38.520 --> 22:39.680
What?

22:39.760 --> 22:40.880
He said

22:40.960 --> 22:42.640
he could help me get rid of Jiang Li.

22:43.920 --> 22:45.040
However,

22:45.120 --> 22:46.560
he wants me to help him

22:48.480 --> 22:49.840
take his revenge first.

22:50.800 --> 22:54.520
Your father nearly beat me
to death back then

22:55.400 --> 22:57.160
and disabled my fingers,

22:57.920 --> 23:00.040
so I could never hold a brush.

23:00.520 --> 23:04.440
Now I want him to cut off an arm

23:05.040 --> 23:09.080
and kowtow to me in person to apologize

23:10.760 --> 23:13.600
for what he did.

23:14.320 --> 23:15.160
What?

23:16.760 --> 23:18.480
Cut off my arm?

23:18.560 --> 23:20.240
Is that why you came to me?

23:20.320 --> 23:22.160
Didn't you say I wasn't cruel enough?

23:23.280 --> 23:24.880
Now, I can be cruel.

23:24.960 --> 23:26.840
All it takes is one of your arms

23:28.360 --> 23:29.480
and a kowtow.

23:29.560 --> 23:31.160
Who does he think he is

23:31.240 --> 23:32.560
to make me cut off my own arm

23:32.640 --> 23:33.800
and kowtow?

23:33.880 --> 23:34.720
Is he worthy?

23:34.800 --> 23:35.640
Yes, he is.

23:36.120 --> 23:38.240
He's now the Imperial Diviner
of the Imperial Diviner Office.

23:38.320 --> 23:40.440
He's just an eighth-rank Imperial Diviner.

23:40.520 --> 23:41.600
Should I be afraid of him?

23:42.160 --> 23:44.240
He's backed by Eldest Princess Wanning.

23:44.840 --> 23:47.960
Besides, the Imperial Diviner
is in charge of imperial divination.

23:48.040 --> 23:49.680
It's not a high-ranking position

23:49.760 --> 23:51.200
but has access to the inner court.

23:51.280 --> 23:52.400
So what?

23:52.880 --> 23:55.520
My daughter is the most favored consort
in the inner court.

23:55.600 --> 23:57.360
So you've survived this long

23:58.760 --> 24:00.960
thanks to your two daughters.

24:01.040 --> 24:03.640
And you dare to complain
that we're not cruel enough.

24:06.520 --> 24:09.560
I'll show you how cruel I can be today.

24:10.880 --> 24:12.560
I'll cut off your arm first

24:12.640 --> 24:16.600
then drag you to Liu Wencai's door.

24:16.680 --> 24:19.160
Liu Wencai has been missing
for so many years

24:19.240 --> 24:22.000
and now, he suddenly came to us
as the Imperial Diviner.

24:22.640 --> 24:24.760
Who knows what he's up to?

24:24.840 --> 24:26.640
You can't let him fool you.

24:26.720 --> 24:27.680
I'm your father,

24:27.760 --> 24:30.800
your birth father who raised you.

24:31.640 --> 24:33.040
Shuran.

24:33.120 --> 24:34.560
Shuran.

24:34.640 --> 24:36.200
Shuran.

24:37.080 --> 24:38.000
Listen to me.

24:39.440 --> 24:40.280
Shuran.

24:40.880 --> 24:42.400
When your mother passed away,

24:43.040 --> 24:44.960
in order to raise you and your sister,

24:45.040 --> 24:47.440
I didn't even think of marrying again,

24:47.520 --> 24:49.560
lest you should suffer.

24:50.640 --> 24:52.480
How can you cut off

24:52.560 --> 24:53.760
your father's arm now

24:53.840 --> 24:55.640
just to deal with a girl?

24:56.240 --> 24:57.840
My good daughter,

24:57.920 --> 25:00.840
you can't be so confused.

25:00.920 --> 25:02.120
Shuran.

25:02.200 --> 25:03.640
Shuran.

25:23.560 --> 25:25.360
It seems like I'm going
to let you down again.

25:28.160 --> 25:29.440
I just can't be as cruel

25:30.880 --> 25:32.800
as you want me to be.

25:48.840 --> 25:49.920
Guards.

25:50.000 --> 25:51.240
Guards!

25:52.320 --> 25:53.680
JIANG FAMILY ANCESTRAL SHRINE

25:53.760 --> 25:55.600
- We're almost there.
- What a crazy woman.

25:55.680 --> 25:58.600
- Why do you keep these things?
- Give it to me.

25:58.680 --> 25:59.840
Just throw them away.

25:59.920 --> 26:01.080
- No.
- Give it to me.

26:01.160 --> 26:03.520
- My Yue'er.
- Give it back to me.

26:03.600 --> 26:04.920
- Give it to me.
- Give it to me now.

26:05.000 --> 26:06.680
- My Yue'er.
- What do you need this for?

26:06.760 --> 26:07.920
- Throw it.
- Give it to me.

26:08.000 --> 26:10.040
- Don't touch a dead person's stuff.
- My Yue'er.

26:10.120 --> 26:10.960
What bad luck.

26:11.040 --> 26:12.040
- No.
- Give it to me.

26:12.120 --> 26:14.040
- Don't take my Yue'er.
- You keep holding the dead's stuff.

26:14.120 --> 26:16.080
- Give it back.
- Is this how you treat your madam?

26:17.360 --> 26:18.200
Ms. Jiang Li.

26:19.720 --> 26:21.240
Do you know the residence's rules?

26:21.800 --> 26:23.160
Ms. Jiang Li, you've misunderstood.

26:23.240 --> 26:24.720
Concubine Hu was hysterical earlier.

26:24.800 --> 26:26.360
That's why I tried to stop her.

26:27.000 --> 26:29.480
If I find out you're treating
your madam like this again,

26:29.960 --> 26:31.400
I'll send you back to Jiang Residence

26:31.480 --> 26:33.520
and praise you well in front of Old Madam.

26:34.080 --> 26:35.320
Ms. Jiang Li, please forgive me.

26:35.400 --> 26:36.560
I know I'm wrong.

26:36.640 --> 26:39.280
- Help your madam inside.
- Yes.

26:40.760 --> 26:41.600
Concubine Hu.

26:41.680 --> 26:42.680
Concubine Hu.

26:42.760 --> 26:43.680
Concubine Hu, let's go.

26:48.440 --> 26:49.720
My Yue'er.

26:50.280 --> 26:51.280
My Yue'er.

26:55.520 --> 26:56.800
Yue'er, don't be afraid.

26:57.920 --> 26:59.040
Don't be afraid.

26:59.520 --> 27:02.280
You've messed up
our ancestral blessed land like this.

27:02.840 --> 27:04.880
The monthly payment is sent here on time.

27:04.960 --> 27:07.560
But you don't even put up
a charcoal fire in the middle of winter

27:07.640 --> 27:09.240
and replace broken window paper.

27:09.320 --> 27:10.840
I should ask you for the accounts.

27:10.920 --> 27:12.240
Yes, we have them.

27:12.320 --> 27:13.760
But Concubine Hu doesn't feel cold,

27:13.840 --> 27:15.560
which is why we didn't use the charcoal.

27:15.640 --> 27:17.480
I've brought some tonic for Concubine Hu.

27:18.040 --> 27:18.880
Tong'er,

27:18.960 --> 27:21.000
teach her how to serve her madam.

27:22.360 --> 27:23.440
Yes.

27:24.280 --> 27:25.120
Let's go.

27:31.840 --> 27:32.880
Yue'er, don't be afraid.

27:33.680 --> 27:35.720
Yue'er, don't be scared.

27:36.640 --> 27:38.480
Yue'er, don't be afraid.

27:38.560 --> 27:39.720
Concubine Hu,

27:41.080 --> 27:42.000
they've left.

27:43.240 --> 27:44.600
We can have a heart-to-heart chat.

27:44.680 --> 27:46.240
My Yue'er feels cold.

27:46.800 --> 27:48.040
She feels cold.

27:50.040 --> 27:50.960
She feels cold.

27:54.640 --> 27:55.600
Yue'er.

27:56.080 --> 27:57.840
- I will only be here this one time.
- Yue'er.

27:59.320 --> 28:00.920
Are you sure you want
to keep putting on an act?

28:05.120 --> 28:06.440
Why did you come to see me?

28:07.880 --> 28:09.360
You're not here to catch up, are you?

28:09.920 --> 28:12.720
I want to hear you and Yue'er's story.

28:14.840 --> 28:16.120
What do you know?

28:16.200 --> 28:17.760
By asking me that,

28:19.360 --> 28:21.120
it means there's something more

28:21.200 --> 28:22.280
to Yue'er's death.

28:27.800 --> 28:30.000
If you're here to talk to me about this,

28:31.440 --> 28:32.360
I have nothing to say.

28:34.280 --> 28:35.840
I don't mean to disturb you.

28:36.560 --> 28:38.960
You and my mother were good friends once.

28:41.000 --> 28:43.920
I remember you always
hugged me when I was little

28:44.720 --> 28:46.280
and Yue'er was very kind to me.

28:47.280 --> 28:48.400
That is why

28:48.480 --> 28:50.040
I don't remember much of what happened

28:50.120 --> 28:51.520
as I was away from home for so long,

28:52.240 --> 28:54.720
but I still feel very close to you
when I see you.

28:55.680 --> 28:58.040
Since you don't want to tell your story,

28:59.320 --> 29:01.440
I'll tell you mine.

29:03.120 --> 29:04.440
I was wronged as a child,

29:05.360 --> 29:06.760
abandoned by my family,

29:07.600 --> 29:09.520
and sent to Qingcheng Mountain
for ten years.

29:11.600 --> 29:15.040
Qingcheng Mountain
was colder than this place.

29:16.080 --> 29:17.760
I had been ignored for ten years

29:18.920 --> 29:21.560
and I learned about people's cruelty.

29:22.440 --> 29:23.880
I didn't see a ray of hope,

29:23.960 --> 29:25.520
but I didn't want to accept my destiny.

29:26.880 --> 29:28.080
If that was my destiny,

29:28.720 --> 29:30.160
I'd go against it

29:30.240 --> 29:31.400
because it was not my fault,

29:31.480 --> 29:32.600
so I would never bow down.

29:33.920 --> 29:35.760
Why should those who do evil

29:35.840 --> 29:37.080
be exalted

29:37.920 --> 29:41.560
and those who were harmed bow down
and be grateful for not being killed?

29:42.600 --> 29:44.840
That's why I had to come down
from the mountain

29:45.680 --> 29:46.880
and return to the capital

29:47.440 --> 29:48.840
to appear in front of the people.

29:49.640 --> 29:50.720
Concubine Hu,

29:50.800 --> 29:52.840
you faked hysteria and survived.

29:52.920 --> 29:55.120
But you've been suffering from the pain

29:55.200 --> 29:56.680
of your daughter's death every day.

29:57.840 --> 30:00.080
Don't you think
you're just as good as dead?

30:01.640 --> 30:03.600
If you're as aggrieved as I am,

30:04.960 --> 30:06.440
I hope you'll come forward.

30:07.000 --> 30:07.960
I will help you

30:08.560 --> 30:09.920
and I'm capable of helping you.

30:12.120 --> 30:13.120
That's all I have to say.

30:14.760 --> 30:16.080
I won't bother you anymore.

30:29.880 --> 30:31.760
My Yue'er was killed!

30:36.160 --> 30:37.080
My…

30:37.160 --> 30:38.800
- My Yue'er was killed!
- Be careful.

30:38.880 --> 30:40.120
Ms. Jiang Li,

30:40.200 --> 30:42.120
Yue'er was killed!

30:42.200 --> 30:44.360
She was killed!

30:44.440 --> 30:47.120
Ms. Jiang Li, please help Yue'er
seek injustice!

30:54.600 --> 30:57.840
IMPERIAL DIVINER OFFICE

31:11.320 --> 31:12.920
I've been waiting for you for so long.

31:13.480 --> 31:14.640
Why are you here alone?

31:18.320 --> 31:19.640
What are you doing?

31:19.720 --> 31:22.160
Don't you want my father
to kneel down and apologize?

31:23.640 --> 31:24.520
I'll kneel for him.

31:24.600 --> 31:26.280
I think you got it wrong.

31:26.360 --> 31:29.080
I want him to cut off an arm

31:29.560 --> 31:31.000
and kowtow to me and apologize.

31:31.080 --> 31:32.080
I'll do it on his behalf.

31:33.120 --> 31:34.040
Do it.

31:34.120 --> 31:35.520
What about what you owe me?

31:35.600 --> 31:38.360
Have you forgotten the fire you set?

31:38.440 --> 31:42.000
Do you want me to give you my life?

31:42.560 --> 31:43.520
You owe me

31:44.480 --> 31:46.440
more than a life.

31:48.600 --> 31:50.680
The Taoist priest said
my nature was extremely yin

31:51.520 --> 31:52.760
and if I cultivated with him,

31:53.360 --> 31:54.960
I'd achieve great things in the future.

31:56.600 --> 31:58.040
He taught me exorcism,

31:58.120 --> 31:59.360
took care of me,

31:59.920 --> 32:01.360
and provided me with food and drinks.

32:02.480 --> 32:05.040
I think this is probably
the heavens' way of compensating me.

32:05.760 --> 32:06.760
But I didn't expect

32:07.720 --> 32:11.200
the greater torture would begin.

32:31.560 --> 32:33.480
This is also part of your cultivation.

32:33.560 --> 32:34.880
If you can't take it,

32:35.880 --> 32:37.080
you can get lost.

32:37.640 --> 32:39.200
I had been through the pain of burning,

32:39.680 --> 32:41.280
so that was nothing.

32:42.280 --> 32:43.680
He said that other people's exorcism

32:43.760 --> 32:46.160
only drove away evil spirits
from their bodies.

32:46.840 --> 32:48.280
But his exorcism

32:48.360 --> 32:49.520
makes evil spirits possess me,

32:49.600 --> 32:51.400
who was reborn from fire,

32:51.480 --> 32:52.600
then destroy them completely.

32:53.200 --> 32:55.800
The more I was drenched in blood
and the more mutilated my body was,

32:55.880 --> 32:57.760
the more the nobles believed in us.

32:58.280 --> 33:00.800
After all, no one
can hurt himself as much as me.

33:01.360 --> 33:04.600
Hence, the nobles are willing
to pay more for it.

33:04.680 --> 33:06.280
As words spread,

33:06.360 --> 33:08.440
we gained popularity in the capital

33:09.080 --> 33:11.800
and even got to meet the Eldest Princess.

33:11.880 --> 33:14.240
I like people like you
who are willing to give it all.

33:14.840 --> 33:16.840
There's a vacancy
in the Imperial Diviner Office.

33:17.680 --> 33:20.240
I can give this position to one person.

33:21.480 --> 33:22.880
You guys talk it over.

33:23.560 --> 33:26.360
I prefer the one who's ruthless.

33:30.520 --> 33:32.720
Didn't you want to die long ago?

33:32.800 --> 33:34.680
Then I'll send you on your way.

33:35.480 --> 33:39.160
I'll pray for you every day from now on.

33:46.880 --> 33:48.760
But since I've decided to live,

33:49.600 --> 33:51.600
I won't die easily.

34:11.000 --> 34:12.400
Thanks to Eldest Princess's support,

34:13.239 --> 34:14.760
I've become the Imperial Diviner.

34:15.760 --> 34:18.000
Do you think your life can compensate

34:19.480 --> 34:22.040
for what I experienced?

34:22.679 --> 34:23.760
I had no choice too.

34:25.520 --> 34:26.880
I was already married back then

34:27.760 --> 34:28.719
and had Ruoyao.

34:29.880 --> 34:31.280
After my father found out about you,

34:32.480 --> 34:33.320
I begged him

34:34.199 --> 34:36.040
so he let me see you one last time.

34:36.679 --> 34:39.159
There's no need to bring up the past.

34:39.880 --> 34:41.000
Let me think about how

34:42.199 --> 34:43.920
I can make you pay back
some interest first.

34:44.679 --> 34:46.639
Do you know why I want
to get rid of Jiang Li?

34:48.760 --> 34:49.960
I don't want to know.

34:54.520 --> 35:01.320
IMPERIAL DIVINER OFFICE

35:15.160 --> 35:16.800
It wasn't an accident that Yue'er fell off

35:17.320 --> 35:18.400
the rockery.

35:19.640 --> 35:21.240
Since Madam Ji married into the family,

35:21.320 --> 35:23.200
I felt something was wrong with her.

35:23.800 --> 35:24.720
You're so beautiful.

35:30.760 --> 35:33.040
So this is the Jiang family's
eldest daughter, Jiang Yue.

35:33.880 --> 35:35.120
She's so adorable.

35:37.440 --> 35:39.240
Although she seemed gentle and elegant

35:39.960 --> 35:41.440
and was nice to Yue'er,

35:42.320 --> 35:43.440
I didn't think

35:44.000 --> 35:45.840
she was as simple as she seemed.

35:46.320 --> 35:49.360
I wanted Yue'er to stay away from her,

35:50.160 --> 35:52.840
but I didn't expect
that something still happened.

35:53.440 --> 35:55.200
Jiang Yue, let me play for a while.

35:55.280 --> 35:57.760
- I won't give it to you.
- Let me play for a while.

35:59.280 --> 36:01.320
Jiang Yue, let me play for a while.

36:01.400 --> 36:02.440
I won't let you play.

36:09.760 --> 36:11.880
- Jiang Yue, let me play for a while.
- Stand up.

36:14.720 --> 36:15.840
Don't cry.

36:17.480 --> 36:18.920
If you want it, go get it yourself.

36:28.280 --> 36:30.280
- Give it to me.
- My mother made this for me.

36:30.360 --> 36:31.600
Don't cry.

36:32.560 --> 36:33.680
I'm not giving it to you.

36:44.760 --> 36:46.240
Ji Shuran asked Ms. Sun

36:46.320 --> 36:47.720
to take Yue to the rockery

36:48.360 --> 36:51.080
to make it look like Yue'er fell from it

36:51.160 --> 36:52.440
and lost her life,

36:53.720 --> 36:56.400
pretending that Ji Shuran
had nothing to do with it.

36:57.840 --> 36:59.000
My Yue'er

37:00.240 --> 37:02.760
died at Ji Shuran's hands.

37:03.640 --> 37:04.840
You weren't at the scene.

37:06.240 --> 37:07.360
How did you know?

37:07.920 --> 37:09.720
My former maid's name was Baoqin.

37:11.000 --> 37:12.480
That day, she was following Yue'er.

37:13.960 --> 37:17.240
She went to the kitchen
to get sweet soup for the kids.

37:17.800 --> 37:19.360
When she came back,

37:19.440 --> 37:21.600
she heard Ji Shuran
giving Ms. Sun instructions,

37:22.360 --> 37:24.360
so she came back and told me immediately.

37:24.440 --> 37:25.760
Where's Baoqin now?

37:26.360 --> 37:27.760
She was made the scapegoat.

37:29.200 --> 37:30.240
After Yue'er's death,

37:31.440 --> 37:33.120
Ji Shuran kicked her out
of Jiang Residence

37:33.200 --> 37:34.920
by saying she didn't
take care of Yue'er well.

37:35.480 --> 37:37.360
She had disappeared since.

37:37.440 --> 37:38.960
You knew about it then.

37:39.760 --> 37:41.400
Why didn't you testify against Ji Shuran?

37:41.480 --> 37:43.040
Testify against her?

37:43.120 --> 37:45.320
Jiang Li, you've been back
in the residence for so long.

37:45.880 --> 37:47.680
Why would you still ask me
something like that?

37:48.760 --> 37:50.240
You should know better than me

37:51.160 --> 37:53.040
what the Jiang family is like.

37:53.720 --> 37:56.840
Just like when you were sent
to Zhennv Hall,

37:58.720 --> 37:59.880
didn't you defend yourself?

38:01.160 --> 38:02.760
Didn't you testify against Ji Shuran?

38:03.960 --> 38:06.040
Did anyone believe a word you said?

38:10.960 --> 38:13.520
Ji Shuran said I have hysteria
and became crazy

38:13.600 --> 38:14.800
because I lost Yue'er,

38:15.360 --> 38:16.280
so I slandered

38:17.040 --> 38:18.040
and framed her.

38:19.160 --> 38:20.040
She's good.

38:20.520 --> 38:21.840
She made herself look innocent

38:22.920 --> 38:26.600
and got a reputation as a virtuous woman
who pitied the weak and the poor.

38:27.160 --> 38:28.160
And I

38:29.320 --> 38:31.200
became the one who was ungrateful.

38:32.120 --> 38:33.920
If Old Madam hadn't considered
my past service

38:34.000 --> 38:35.240
and defended me,

38:35.320 --> 38:37.760
I would have been sent to Zhennv Hall.

38:38.960 --> 38:39.920
Later on,

38:40.880 --> 38:42.680
I succumbed to Ji Shuran

38:43.840 --> 38:45.160
and pretended to have hysteria.

38:47.680 --> 38:49.640
The Jiang family couldn't keep me
in the residence,

38:50.160 --> 38:51.520
so they sent me here

38:53.400 --> 38:55.120
and I managed to survive.

38:59.400 --> 39:00.800
And not a single person

39:02.160 --> 39:03.720
in the entire family suspected her?

39:03.800 --> 39:05.320
She's Madam Ji,

39:06.480 --> 39:08.040
the current legitimate wife.

39:08.840 --> 39:10.240
She's gentle, elegant,

39:10.320 --> 39:11.360
and virtuous.

39:11.840 --> 39:13.160
Who would believe that

39:13.240 --> 39:16.880
she would kill an illegitimate daughter
who isn't in her way?

39:17.440 --> 39:19.160
Even if someone found it strange,

39:19.720 --> 39:21.880
the Ji family was flourishing at that time

39:22.920 --> 39:25.280
and there was a favored Consort Li
to support them.

39:25.840 --> 39:27.840
Who would offend the Ji family

39:27.920 --> 39:29.160
for a dead person?

39:30.240 --> 39:31.120
Ms. Jiang Li,

39:31.600 --> 39:33.000
you're part of the Jiang family too.

39:34.040 --> 39:35.160
You can see

39:36.240 --> 39:38.360
the favors and profits better than I do.

39:41.920 --> 39:43.040
Evil has its retribution.

39:44.840 --> 39:48.680
I'll definitely redress
Yue'er's injustice.

40:12.280 --> 40:13.120
Greetings, Mother.

40:14.960 --> 40:17.200
If you were out in this rain,

40:17.280 --> 40:18.920
you must be on an important errand.

40:19.000 --> 40:22.320
I bet you were on an important errand too.

40:22.880 --> 40:24.320
I don't have any important matters.

40:25.280 --> 40:27.440
It's all for you kids.

40:28.480 --> 40:29.720
Sorry to have troubled you.

40:31.160 --> 40:32.280
Mother,

40:32.760 --> 40:33.680
you should mind

40:33.760 --> 40:36.320
your own matters when you have time too.

40:38.920 --> 40:40.360
As a mother,

40:40.440 --> 40:42.840
the children's matters come first.

40:43.720 --> 40:44.840
Li'er, go in quickly.

40:46.040 --> 40:47.640
Don't get cold from the wind and rain.

40:48.200 --> 40:49.240
Mother,

40:49.320 --> 40:50.240
after you.

41:27.800 --> 41:28.640
Madam Ji.

41:29.120 --> 41:29.960
What's the matter?

41:30.440 --> 41:31.880
A servant reported

41:31.960 --> 41:34.520
that Jiang Li went
to Concubine Hu's place.

41:34.600 --> 41:36.600
They talked for a long time
with the door closed

41:37.160 --> 41:39.120
and Concubine Hu didn't behave madly.

41:39.720 --> 41:43.480
It seems like she wants
to settle old scores with me this time.

41:45.920 --> 41:47.360
Concubine Hu

41:47.840 --> 41:49.760
has been pretending to be crazy
for so many years.

41:50.360 --> 41:51.840
It's really hard for her.

41:52.400 --> 41:54.520
Shall we let Concubine Hu…

41:57.720 --> 41:59.200
Jiang Li has already gone to her,

41:59.920 --> 42:01.720
so she'll let people watch her.

42:03.160 --> 42:05.760
A sinful woman
who committed matricide and fratricide

42:05.840 --> 42:07.760
and a crazy concubine.

42:08.920 --> 42:10.960
If they associate with each other,

42:11.040 --> 42:12.760
they'll be the ones in deep trouble.

42:33.320 --> 42:34.200
Ms. Ruoyao,

42:34.840 --> 42:35.760
time to get up and eat.

42:36.720 --> 42:38.400
Madam Ji prepared some calming soup.

42:39.480 --> 42:40.720
Get up and have some.

42:59.040 --> 43:00.160
Ms. Sun,

43:00.240 --> 43:01.080
you…

43:01.880 --> 43:02.760
Ms. Ruoyao,

43:04.360 --> 43:06.240
it's all for your own good.

43:06.320 --> 43:08.160
After you wake up,

43:08.240 --> 43:10.040
everything will be fine.

43:15.280 --> 43:16.160
What have you done?

43:22.440 --> 43:24.200
What have you done to me?

43:25.480 --> 43:26.640
What have you done?

43:29.000 --> 43:30.600
Say it!

43:31.240 --> 43:32.960
- Ms. Ruoyao has gone mad!
- Say it.

43:33.040 --> 43:34.760
Ms. Ruoyao has gone crazy!

43:34.840 --> 43:36.880
It's all for your own good.

43:36.960 --> 43:37.880
Ms. Ruoyao.

43:40.640 --> 43:44.240
Ms. Ruoyao, I'm doing this
for your own good.

43:56.680 --> 43:57.880
What did the physician say?

43:58.720 --> 44:00.120
Several physicians examined her.

44:01.040 --> 44:03.640
They all say
there's nothing wrong with her pulse

44:04.640 --> 44:06.040
and there are no symptoms.

44:06.120 --> 44:07.840
But they couldn't tell us clearly

44:07.920 --> 44:09.280
why a healthy person

44:11.240 --> 44:12.880
would suddenly be in such a state.

44:15.640 --> 44:16.560
My lord,

44:17.320 --> 44:20.560
forgive me for speaking impudent words.

44:20.640 --> 44:22.440
Ms. Ruoyao seems like…

44:22.520 --> 44:23.360
She seems like

44:24.240 --> 44:27.600
someone who has been possessed
by an evil spirit in my hometown.

44:28.360 --> 44:30.320
Ms. Sun, what nonsense
are you talking about?

44:31.040 --> 44:33.480
I raised Ms. Ruoyao.

44:34.080 --> 44:35.920
She's in such a state now.

44:36.000 --> 44:38.080
I wouldn't talk nonsense.

44:38.160 --> 44:40.880
This may be my own stupid idea,

44:41.920 --> 44:43.280
but since ancient times,

44:43.360 --> 44:46.040
many people vaguely died in this way.

44:46.120 --> 44:48.760
My lord, let's get someone
to check on Ms. Ruoyao.

44:48.840 --> 44:50.600
But where can we find

44:51.240 --> 44:53.240
such an expert in the capital?

44:53.320 --> 44:54.800
Don't talk nonsense

44:54.880 --> 44:56.280
about the supernatural.

44:57.000 --> 44:59.320
Ruoyao has no other symptoms.

44:59.400 --> 45:01.840
Don't get those
who deliberately mystify themselves here

45:01.920 --> 45:03.520
and cause rumors to spread.

45:06.160 --> 45:07.480
What about my Yao'er?

45:13.440 --> 45:14.480
An evil spirit?

45:15.080 --> 45:17.480
Ruoyao's condition is strange.

45:18.000 --> 45:19.440
It's good to get her checked.

45:20.240 --> 45:21.360
Since you've decided,

45:22.360 --> 45:23.480
you can do as she says.

45:23.560 --> 45:26.200
I'm going to write a letter
to the Imperial Diviner now.

45:27.240 --> 45:30.240
Mother, take good care of yourself.

45:30.320 --> 45:33.680
You'd better stay home these days.

45:33.760 --> 45:35.040
Don't worry.

45:49.840 --> 45:50.680
Old Madam,

45:51.200 --> 45:53.360
do you believe
in what they say about Ms. Ruoyao?

45:53.440 --> 45:56.960
The supernatural isn't
from the mortal world.

45:58.200 --> 45:59.160
I can't see it.

45:59.240 --> 46:00.680
But if it's the doing of humans,

46:02.600 --> 46:05.560
we'll figure it out eventually.

46:19.760 --> 46:20.760
Tell Chancellor Jiang

46:21.360 --> 46:22.440
that I'll be there tomorrow.

46:22.520 --> 46:23.360
Yes.

46:34.720 --> 46:35.720
There's a ghost.

46:36.720 --> 46:38.280
Jiang Li, there's a ghost.

46:38.360 --> 46:39.240
There's a ghost.

46:40.360 --> 46:41.280
What's wrong?

46:41.360 --> 46:42.240
Where's the ghost?

46:44.280 --> 46:45.120
You're not aware.

46:45.200 --> 46:46.520
Something big has happened.

46:46.600 --> 46:48.160
Jiang Ruoyao is possessed
by an evil spirit.

46:48.240 --> 46:50.400
And they invited the Imperial Diviner
to exorcise her.

46:50.480 --> 46:51.400
The Imperial Diviner?

46:51.480 --> 46:54.560
The Imperial Diviner is very creepy.

46:56.760 --> 47:00.320
It's true that the imperial family
is the most merciless.

47:00.880 --> 47:02.920
Has anything happened
in the imperial court lately?

47:03.000 --> 47:03.840
There have been

47:04.560 --> 47:06.160
a lot of deaths in the harem a while ago.

47:07.360 --> 47:09.280
One day, a maid dies.

47:09.760 --> 47:11.440
The next day, a eunuch.

47:12.080 --> 47:14.360
It's all over the palace

47:14.440 --> 47:16.480
that an evil spirit is there.

47:17.160 --> 47:18.000
After that,

47:18.480 --> 47:20.560
- Evil spirit?
- the Imperial Diviner performed exorcism.

47:21.040 --> 47:22.040
The Imperial Diviner said

47:22.640 --> 47:24.640
an evil spirit possessed a consort.

47:25.720 --> 47:27.600
His Majesty showed no mercy

47:27.680 --> 47:29.840
and granted her poisonous liquor that day.

47:30.520 --> 47:32.160
Rumor has it that the poor consort

47:32.240 --> 47:34.280
didn't even have a chance
to defend herself

47:34.360 --> 47:35.360
and was…

47:36.320 --> 47:38.680
Do you think the Imperial Diviner
will catch the evil spirit

47:38.760 --> 47:40.240
in our house?

47:40.320 --> 47:41.560
Since he's here,

47:42.400 --> 47:44.120
they won't return empty-handed.

47:44.200 --> 47:45.120
They?

47:45.200 --> 47:47.200
Do you really think
Jiang Ruoyao is possessed?

47:49.040 --> 47:49.920
I got it.

47:50.720 --> 47:51.680
According to you,

47:51.760 --> 47:53.560
Ji Shuran is too cruel.

47:54.080 --> 47:55.600
She even sacrificed her own daughter.

47:55.680 --> 47:57.680
Who can be the evil spirit
in the whole Jiang family

47:57.760 --> 47:58.960
but you?

47:59.040 --> 48:01.680
I'm going to be the evil spirit this time.
